  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Peter Lünstroth founded the agency in <span class="stat">1994</span>, initially as a strategic marketing consultancy. Growing demand for execution alongside consulting soon gave rise to the advertising agency — first under the name "planet weco", since 2006 under the founder's name.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">Peter Lünstroth lectures at the German Federal Patent Court, was an adjunct lecturer at FHM Bielefeld, and holds degrees in law, ethnology, philosophy and political science — a broad academic approach that still shapes the agency's thinking today.</p>

